# Local port forwards: apps on the Miyoo connect to 127.0.0.1:LOCALPORT and
# reach HOST:PORT on your tailnet. One per line: LOCALPORT  HOST:PORT
# HOST can be a MagicDNS name (homeserver) or a 100.x address.
# Your tailnet policy must allow this device to reach HOST:PORT.
#
# 8096  homeserver:8096      # Jellyfin
# 4533  homeserver:4533      # Navidrome
# 61208 nas:61208  # Glances
# 8090  nas:8090   # Beszel
